#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "How to use the Sampler primitive with the IBM Quantum Compute Service REST API."
msgstr "Comment utiliser la primitive Sampler avec l'API REST d'IBM Quantum Compute Service."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Sampler with the REST API"
msgstr "Sampler avec l'API REST"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "{/* cspell:ignore IIZII, XIZZZ, accum */}\n"
msgstr "{/* cspell:ignore IIZII, XIZZZ, accum */}\n"

#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Sampler with the REST API {#sampler-with-the-rest-api}"
msgstr "Sampler avec l'API REST {#sampler-with-the-rest-api}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The steps in this topic describe how to run and configure workloads with the REST API, and demonstrate how to invoke them in any program of your choice.\n"
msgstr "Les étapes décrites dans cette rubrique expliquent comment exécuter et configurer des workloads avec l'API REST, et montrent comment les invoquer dans n'importe quel programme de ton choix.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid ""
#| "<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
#| "This documentation utilizes the Python `requests` module to demonstrate the Qiskit Runtime REST API. However, this workflow can be executed using any language or framework that supports working with REST APIs. Refer to the [API reference documentation](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/tags/jobs) for details.\n"
#| "</Admonition>\n"
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"This documentation utilizes the Python `requests` module to demonstrate the IBM Quantum Compute Service REST API. However, this workflow can be executed using any language or framework that supports working with REST APIs. Refer to the [API reference documentation](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-runtime-rest) for details.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"Cette documentation utilise le module Python `requests` pour illustrer l'API REST de Qiskit Runtime. Cependant, ce workflow peut être exécuté en utilisant n'importe quel langage ou framework prenant en charge les API REST. Consulte la [documentation de référence de l'API](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/tags/jobs) pour plus de détails.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "1. Initialize the account {#1-initialize-the-account}"
msgstr "1. Initialiser le compte {#1-initialize-the-account}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You first need to initialize your account. You can then select the device you want to use to run your calculations on.\n"
msgstr "Tu dois d'abord initialiser ton compte. Tu peux ensuite sélectionner l'appareil sur lequel tu veux exécuter tes calculs.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Find details on how to initialize your account, view available backends, and work with tokens in [Set up to use IBM Quantum Platform with REST API](/guides/cloud-setup-rest-api).\n"
msgstr "Trouve des détails sur la façon d'initialiser ton compte, d'afficher les backends disponibles et de travailler avec des tokens dans [Configurer l'utilisation d'IBM Quantum Platform avec l'API REST](/guides/cloud-setup-rest-api).\n"

