msgstr "2. Créer un circuit QASM {#2-create-a-qasm-circuit}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You need at least one circuit as the input to the Sampler primitive.\n"
msgstr "Tu as besoin d'au moins un circuit comme entrée de la primitive Sampler.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Define a QASM quantum circuit:\n"
msgstr "Définis un circuit quantique QASM :\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
