msgstr "Les extraits de code donnés ci-dessous supposent que le `qasm_string` a été transcompilé en une nouvelle chaîne `resulting_qasm`.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "3. Run the quantum circuit using Sampler V2 API {#3-run-the-quantum-circuit-using-sampler-v2-api}"
msgstr "3. Exécuter le circuit quantique à l'aide de l'API Sampler V2 {#3-run-the-quantum-circuit-using-sampler-v2-api}"

#. type: Plain text
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid ""
#| "<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
#| "The jobs below use [Qiskit Runtime V2 primitives](/guides/v2-primitives). `SamplerV2` takes one or more primitive unified blocs (PUBs) as the input. Each PUB is a tuple that contains one circuit and the data broadcasted to that circuit, which can be multiple parameters, and returns one result per PUB.\n"
#| "</Admonition>\n"
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"The jobs below use IBM Quantum V2 primitives. `SamplerV2` takes one or more primitive unified blocs (PUBs) as the input. Each PUB is a tuple that contains one circuit and the data broadcasted to that circuit, which can be multiple parameters, and returns one result per PUB.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"Les jobs ci-dessous utilisent les [primitives Qiskit Runtime V2](/guides/v2-primitives). `SamplerV2` prend en entrée un ou plusieurs blocs unifiés de primitives (PUBs). Chaque PUB est un tuple qui contient un circuit et les données diffusées à ce circuit, qui peuvent être plusieurs paramètres, et renvoie un résultat par PUB.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

